        "id": 2,
        "category": "word_sense",
        "term_en": "comprise vs consist",
        "meaning_zh": "comprise：包括、由…组成；consist：由…构成",
        "usage_example": "Comprise: The committee comprises ten members. Consist: The committee consists of ten members.",
        "study_note": "用comprise时跟宾语直接搭配，不需要of，如'comprises thousands of bulbs'。用consist时必须接of，表示由某些部分组成，如'consists of thousands of bulbs'。",
