        "id": 3,
        "category": "word_sense",
        "term_en": "cooperation vs collaboration",
        "meaning_zh": "cooperation：配合、协作；collaboration：协作、共创",
        "usage_example": "Cooperation: Thank you for your cooperation. Collaboration: The two companies collaborated on a new product.",
        "study_note": "Cooperation强调不添乱、愿意帮忙，更多出现在非正式和不对等的关系中；而collaboration强调共同参与、创造，通常各方地位平等，目标一致。collaboration有时也指负面意义的通敌行为。",
